OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit stays suspended
OL,4,Aafter latest review
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirthing services at a hospital
OL,7,Fmaternity unit are to remain closed
OL,8,Ffollowing a readiness assessment by its
OL,9,Ftrust, it has confirmed.
OL,11,FThe services at North Devon District
OL,12,FHospital (NDDH) have been suspended
OL,13,Fsince 11 August because of staff
OL,14,Fshortages raising safety concerns.
OL,16,FChecks were carried out by Royal Devon
OL,17,FUniversity Healthcare NHS Foundation
OL,18,FTrust on Monday, which said the next
OL,19,Fassessment was due to take place on
OL,20,FMonday 9 November.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
