OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit stays suspended
OL,4,Aafter latest review
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen are being asked to continue to
OL,7,F"follow their personalised birth plans
OL,8,Fon the basis of giving birth at the
OL,9,FRD&E [Royal Devon & Exeter] or their
OL,10,Fnext nearest hospital".
